  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Whats good about Elegear cooling blanket?</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span data-offset-key=\"5ls6j-0-0\">Absorbs body heat, reducing skin temperature instantly. Q-Max＞0.5. </span><span data-offset-key=\"5ls6j-0-1\">While coziness is a selling point, the cooling effect is what sets it apart from other blankets. This blanket is cooling and refreshing, especially when you place the cooling side against your skin.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"80o9r-0-0\" data-editor=\"2l4tp\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"80o9r-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"80o9r-0-0\">What is Arc-Chill cooling fiber?</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"dpkii-0-0\" data-editor=\"2l4tp\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"dpkii-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"dpkii-0-0\">It is a revolutionary high-performance functional textile,&nbsp;made&nbsp;with&nbsp;conductive cross-section polyester&nbsp;fibers&nbsp;and&nbsp;jade&nbsp;particles which&nbsp;wick away humidity from the skin, accelerate moisture evaporation, absorb excess body heat, and produce a feeling of coolness and freshness. </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\" data-editor=\"2l4tp\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\">The jade particles produce an endothermic reaction that absorbs energy, while the modified conductive cross-section polyester speeds up moisture evaporation when the body perspires. The combination produces a cool sensation and reduces skin temperature by 35.6-41℉.</span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\">Target Audience </span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"6r58-0-0\">\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"fipse-0-0\">\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"fipse-0-0\" data-editor=\"195ja\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"fipse-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"fipse-0-0\">People who suffer from various medical conditions such as hot flashes, night sweats, anxiety, hyperthyroidism, etc.</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"1v8af-0-0\" data-editor=\"2dj8m\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"1v8af-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"1v8af-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Hot Sleepers or Women during preganancy or menopause.</span></span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"d4an7-0-0\" data-editor=\"5o4uq\" data-block=\"true\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"d4an7-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"d4an7-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Anyone looking for a way to relax and cool down during the summer would benefit from this soothing and chilling summer blanket. It provides a good night's sleep and helps to cool down after coming back from outside in hot days, or after exercising to relax muscles and nerves.</span></span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"1v8af-0-0\" data-editor=\"2dj8m\" data-block=\"true\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-offset-key=\"fipse-0-0\" data-editor=\"195ja\" data-block=\"true\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
